# Project Data

Source: [Kaggle — March Machine Learning Mania 2026](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/march-machine-learning-mania-2026/data)

These datasets will be used to combine regular-season team statistics
with NCAA tournament seeds and outcomes to study predictors of upsets.

## Files

- **MRegularSeasonDetailedResults.csv:** Regular-season game results
  and detailed box-score statistics.
- **MNCAATourneyCompactResults.csv:** NCAA tournament game results,
  including winning and losing teams and scores.
- **MNCAATourneySeeds.csv:** Tournament seeds for each team by season.
- **MTeams.csv:** Team identification numbers and corresponding names.

The CSV files are original downloads and have not been modified.
